        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butter Side Down is a bizarro choose-your-own-choice game. Starring Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, and Rotten Ruggerio. Answer questions, take calls, play card games, and solve one hell of a mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An All Star Cast:</strong> Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, Rotten Ruggerio, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Factions:</strong> The F.A.C.T.S. Department, The Money Men, Da Union, and The Company Of Jesters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The BC-3:</strong> A fully-featured, period-accurate virtual computer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Question Answering:</strong> Your choices will  determine the ultimate fate of your coworkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phone Calls:</strong> Call your coworkers. Receive calls from strangers. It’s fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Games:</strong> Play classic card games like Sacrimoni Slap and Brannigan’s Wager. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNDSCP-305:</strong> A soundtrack built dynamically based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> There are 45 endings. Or more?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Hell Of A Mystery:</strong> Join the hunt for the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More:</strong> Extras, secrets, and achievements.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butter Side Down is a bizarro choose-your-own-choice game. Starring Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, and Rotten Ruggerio. Answer questions, take calls, play card games, and solve one hell of a mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An All Star Cast:</strong> Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, Rotten Ruggerio, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Factions:</strong> The F.A.C.T.S. Department, The Money Men, Da Union, and The Company Of Jesters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The BC-3:</strong> A fully-featured, period-accurate virtual computer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Question Answering:</strong> Your choices will  determine the ultimate fate of your coworkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phone Calls:</strong> Call your coworkers. Receive calls from strangers. It’s fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Games:</strong> Play classic card games like Sacrimoni Slap and Brannigan’s Wager. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNDSCP-305:</strong> A soundtrack built dynamically based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> There are 45 endings. Or more?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Hell Of A Mystery:</strong> Join the hunt for the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More:</strong> Extras, secrets, and achievements.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Butter Side Down is a bizarro choose-your-own-choice game. Starring Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, and Rotten Ruggerio. Answer questions, take calls, play card games, and solve one hell of a mystery.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“It’s an interesting world that Butter Side Down presents. Aliens, vampires, jesters, French Partisan alligators; they tie together in a strangely believable manner. Feels like I’m working in an office again. Doing pointless tasks and commiserating with co-workers.”<br>Maximum Utmost<br>",
